    ingredients: "2 cups all-purpose flour\n1 packet active dry yeast\n1 tsp sugar\n¾ cup warm water\n½ cup San Marzano tomato sauce\n8 oz fresh mozzarella, sliced\nFresh basil leaves\nExtra-virgin olive oil\nSea salt",
    instructions: "Dissolve yeast and sugar in warm water; bloom 5 min. Mix flour and salt, add yeast, knead until smooth. Rise 1 hour. Punch down, stretch into 12-inch round. Spread sauce, top with mozzarella. Bake at 500°F on stone 8–10 min. Add basil, drizzle olive oil, serve."
  },
