    instructions: "Mix yogurt with spices and ginger-garlic paste. Cut chicken, marinate 2 hr. Broil on skewers until charred, ~12 min. Sauté onion, add spices and tomatoes, simmer 15 min. Stir in cream and chicken, simmer 10 min. Garnish with cilantro, serve over rice."
