    instructions: "Preheat oven to 400°F. Whisk melted butter with garlic, lemon zest, lemon juice, and mustard. Arrange salmon and asparagus on a parchment-lined sheet pan. Brush lemon-garlic butter over salmon; drizzle rest over asparagus. Season with salt and pepper. Roast 12–14 min until salmon flakes easily. Garnish with fresh dill."
  },
