    instructions: "Whisk flour, sugar, baking powder, baking soda, and salt. In another bowl, whisk buttermilk, egg, and melted butter. Combine wet and dry; do not overmix. Fold in banana slices and walnuts. Heat griddle over medium heat, butter lightly. Pour ¼-cup portions. Cook until bubbles form on top, flip, cook 2 min. Serve with maple syrup and extra banana slices."
