    instructions: "Heat a splash of coconut milk in a wok and stir-fry green curry paste until fragrant, about 2 min. Add remaining coconut milk, bring to a simmer. Add chicken, eggplant, bamboo shoots, and lime leaves. Simmer 15 min until chicken is cooked. Season with fish sauce and brown sugar. Remove from heat, stir in Thai basil. Serve over jasmine rice."
