    instructions: "Mash anchovy fillets and garlic into a paste. Whisk in egg yolk, lemon juice, and mustard. Slowly drizzle in olive oil while whisking until emulsified. Tear romaine into bite-sized pieces. Toss with dressing until coated. Add croutons and most of the Parmesan; toss. Plate and top with remaining Parmesan and pepper."
