    instructions: "Whisk soy sauce, oyster sauce, cornstarch, brown sugar, ginger, and garlic. Toss beef with half the sauce; marinate 15 min. Heat oil in a wok over high heat. Stir-fry beef in batches until browned, about 2 min per batch; set aside. Add broccoli and a splash of water; cover and steam 2 min. Return beef, add remaining sauce, toss until thickened. Sprinkle sesame seeds, serve over rice."
